on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <7>
  [  5] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(7)>
  [  8] getobjprop 95 ........................... <sprite(7).visible>
  [ 11] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 14] eq ...................................... <sprite(7).visible = 1>
  [ 15] jmpifz [ 62] ............................ if sprite(7).visible = 1 then / else
  [ 18] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 21] pusharglist 1 ........................... <2>
