  [ 37] pushsymb 42 ............................. <#playFile>
  [ 40] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 43] getglobal 32 ............................ <effectspath>
  [ 46] pushcons 8 .............................. <"lgtbrk.aif">
